    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Plaques unveiling ceremony was held on Friday December 05, 2003 at 2:00 PM in Aga Khan University (AKU) Lecture Hall. Eight independent plaques, sandblasted with the names of donors endowed professorships for research, scholarship and information technology, were unveiled by Saidullah Khan Dehlavi, Chairman, Board of Trustees of AKU.",
